Package: device-port-monitor
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libnotify-bin, gnome-session-canberra, systemd
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Maintainer: cds730@konkuk.ac.kr
Description: GNOME top-bar monitor for ACM, USB serial, and video devices
 Shows ttyACM, ttyUSB, and video device counts as separate AppIndicator groups,
 sends notifications with distinct connection sounds, and provides a small
 autostart settings UI.
